{"id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-machine.md","title":"Oracle 机器与查询步","display":"df-oracle-machine — Oracle 机器与查询步","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-machine","aliases":["20-df-oracle-machine"],"display":"df-oracle-machine — Oracle 机器与查询步","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 3.2.1–3.2.2；本地确定性查询元组展开","source_pdf_pages":[88,89,90],"source_printed_pages":[52,53,54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tmcomp]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-machine — Oracle 机器与查询步"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 3.2.1–3.2.2；本地确定性查询元组展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88</span><span>89</span><span>90</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>52</span><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\circ=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(M^\\circ=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span> 为普通程序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_q\\subseteq Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(Q_q\\subseteq Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> 为查询状态集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0,b_1:Q_q\\to Q\">\\(b_0,b_1:Q_q\\to Q\\)</span> 全定义。oracle 程序为有限元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M^\\circ,Q_q,b_0,b_1)\">\\(M=(M^\\circ,Q_q,b_0,b_1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,c&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ}\">\\(c,c&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ},\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h):=\\mu j\\ge1\\ [t(h+j)\\ne1]-1\\quad(t(h)=1),\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M^A(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n[q\\notin Q_q\\land(q,t,h)\\to_{M^\\circ}(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)]\n\\lor[q\\in Q_q\\land t(h)=1\\land\nq&#39;=b_{\\chi_A(\\operatorname{num}(t,h))}(q)\\land t&#39;=t\\land h&#39;=h].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ},\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h):=\\mu j\\ge1\\ [t(h+j)\\ne1]-1\\quad(t(h)=1),\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M^A(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n[q\\notin Q_q\\land(q,t,h)\\to_{M^\\circ}(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)]\n\\lor[q\\in Q_q\\land t(h)=1\\land\nq&#39;=b_{\\chi_A(\\operatorname{num}(t,h))}(q)\\land t&#39;=t\\land h&#39;=h].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>普通程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\circ\">\\(M^\\circ\\)</span>、查询状态和两张跳转表都是已绑定的有限参数。查询状态不执行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>；其他状态只执行普通单步关系。停止状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 不属于查询状态且没有普通后继。有限支撑保证合法查询块的右端空白存在，因此 num 的搜索停止。由普通程序确定性和二值查询跳转，每个配置至多一个后继。</p>\n<p>查询指令把头下连续一元块译为查询数，按其是否属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 跳转。正常停止输出沿用 tmcomp：整条磁带上 1 的总数；它与查询译码不同。查询头下不是 1 时没有后继且不产生正常输出。输入配置仍为普通 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0(x)\">\\(c_0(x)\\)</span>。有限元组可有效编号，与原书的额外 oracle 纸带模型可通过保存工作配置、复制有限查询块与恢复工作配置互相编译。这里显示的是该等价查询模型的本地展开。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 3.2.1–3.2.2；印刷 52–54 / PDF 88–90。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M^\\circ=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"Q_q\\subseteq Q\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b_0,b_1:Q_q\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M^\\circ,Q_q,b_0,b_1)","display":false},{"tex":"c,c'\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ},\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h):=\\mu j\\ge1\\ [t(h+j)\\ne1]-1\\quad(t(h)=1),\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M^A(q',t',h')\\Longleftrightarrow\n[q\\notin Q_q\\land(q,t,h)\\to_{M^\\circ}(q',t',h')]\n\\lor[q\\in Q_q\\land t(h)=1\\land\nq'=b_{\\chi_A(\\operatorname{num}(t,h))}(q)\\land t'=t\\land h'=h].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"M^\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"c_0(x)","display":false}],"bytes":2381,"backlinks":[{"id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-machine]] — 章 3；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-machine]]"}],"outgoing":["04aa1148d91b88f8","de14d8d6c42250de"]}